#: krunnerapp.cpp:312
msgid ""
"Could not log out properly.\n"
"The session manager cannot be contacted. You can try to force a shutdown by "
"pressing Ctrl+Alt+Backspace; note, however, that your current session will "
"not be saved with a forced shutdown."
msgstr ""
"Nie mòże pòprawno wëlogòwac.\n"
"Menadżera sesëji nie mòże bëc pòdłączonô. Mòżesz spróbòwac wëmùszëc "
"zamkniãcé wcëskając Ctrl+Alt+Backspace. Bôczë, że Twòjô biéżnô sesëja nie "
"mdze zapisónô pò wëmùszonym zamkniãcu."

